# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Scratch inside src/ and include/ (2026-07-25)
#
# Notes, chat dumps, session archives, and data files living in the SOURCE
# tree. These got swept into a commit by a directory-level git add (the
# AIF-050 backfill incident, force-push-repaired same day). Ignore the clear
# scratch categories so it cannot happen again.
#
# NOT ignored (left visible as untracked, promote or delete deliberately):
#   src/tests/*.cpp, src/reference/, src/schemas/, src/cli/cmd_transaction.cpp
#   and other plausible future source.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CORRECTED 2026-07-25, same day, by the rule in AIF-062. The first draft of this
# section ignored /src/AIPortal/, /src/**/*.patch and /src/**/*.dts as "scratch". That
# was the identical mistake the *.log rule made: src/AIPortal/sessions/ is the
# OUTSIDE-AI CHANGE PACKAGE INTAKE AREA, and the contract
# (labtalk/ai_portal/EXTERNAL_AI_CHANGE_PACKAGE_V1.md) requires the received archive be
# PRESERVED AS INTAKE EVIDENCE. 46 files were hidden, including AI_CHANGE_PACKAGE_*.md,
# BUILD_TEST_PLAN_*, closeouts, and 7 .patch deliverables. `.patch` and `.dts` are
# DELIVERABLE TYPES here, not noise -- never blanket-ignore them.
#
# What remains ignored is only what is genuinely disposable: loose prose dropped in the
# source tree, pre-edit sidecars, and binary/data blobs.

# prose/notes dropped into the source tree (CMakeLists.txt is unaffected:
# gitignore never hides tracked files, and new cmake files are *.txt-negated)
/src/**/*.txt
!/src/**/CMakeLists.txt
!/src/AIPortal/**
# src/url is a deliberate curated-URL home, not disposable prose -- track its .txt
!/src/url/**
/include/*.txt
# pre-edit sidecars only -- NOT .patch or .dts, which are deliverables
/src/**/*.before_image_web_defaults
# archives and binary data inside src/ and include/
/src/*.zip
/src/data/
/include/manuals/
# collection stubs parked under src/ (prose only; AIPortal is intake evidence, kept)
/src/psych/
/src/labtalk/

